  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6c8c
  clock: 19  # 6c8c
  nonce: 6c8c  # 6c8c
  message: "CORRECTION to the entry immediately above: three words were eaten by shell\ncommand substitution (backticks in a double-quoted argument) before the message\nwas stored. The elisions and their restorations, so no reader has to guess:\n\n  1. \"cannot actually produce a false ___ in a repository that imports requests\n     at all\"                                                 -> CONFIRMED\n  2. \"so the verdict is already ___ before receiver typing is reached\"\n                                                             -> INCONCLUSIVE\n  3. \"so ___.dumps in a module slot can match a catalogue module\"\n                                                             -> JSON\n\nNo number or claim in that entry is affected; three nouns went missing and two\nsentences lost the verdict word that carried their point. The tooling note is\nalready on the record elsewhere and applies here: `tracker discuss` takes its\nmessage as an ARGUMENT, so it must be built from a QUOTED heredoc into a\nvariable and passed as \"$MSG\" -- exactly the way this correction was."  # 6c8c
